 "day2_check": {
  "_note": "GDD section 6: 'a new Tinker's total level passes 50 within two days'. 48 work hours: 24 h combat (main skill 70%, six others 5% each) and 24 h split evenly across three non-combat skills (Prospecting, Smithing, Tinkering, the first-session chain in section 7), all at the reference rate. Six skills untouched at level 1. The pass depends on spreading XP: with the same 24 non-combat hours in one non-combat skill the total is 47; split across two it is exactly 50, which does not pass; and at an 80/20 or 90/10 combat split (main skill / six others) even three non-combat skills give exactly 50.",
